# Prototype Git Scope

The portal splits prototype work into two product areas:

1. **核心模块** (`/canvas/core`) — Git-backed interaction templates maintained by the platform owner.
2. **原型创作** (`/canvas/studio`) — Project-card gallery for local Studio explorations; each active project opens on its own detail route.

## What belongs in GitHub (push / PR)

Include when the work is reviewed and intended for the whole team:

- Core prototype screens under `apps/design-system-portal/src/components/prototypes/`
- Prototype registration: `prototype-app-routes.ts`, `prototype-app-router.tsx`, `prototype-preview-showcase.tsx`
- Kit components, tokens, icons, and shared CSS used by core templates
- Specs, tests, and docs for stabilized interactions

## What must NOT go to GitHub

Never commit or push:

- Studio-only session data and local project catalog mutations from **原型创作**
- Unvalidated studio drafts, throwaway prompts, or experimental layouts that are not approved for core
- Personal reference screenshots uploaded only for local studio exploration unless explicitly requested for the repo

## PR hygiene

- Keep PRs focused on **core templates** or **studio platform code**, not both unless clearly separated in the description.
- Do not register a studio experiment in the core catalog until it is reviewed and implemented as a real `*-prototype.tsx`.
- When updating core templates, note in the PR if shared Kit/CSS may affect other core screens.

## Promotion path

Studio exploration → review → implement as core TSX → register in catalog → PR to `main`.

Until promotion, studio work stays local.

## Agent default (unless the user says otherwise)

- **New pages, visual redesigns, and reference-driven explorations** (e.g. Mobbin / Meetup-style layouts) → implement under **原型创作** (`components/studio/*`, `/canvas/studio/[projectId]`), with Studio session keys and `.studio*` CSS.
- **Do not change 核心模块** (`components/prototypes/*-prototype.tsx`, core feed/room/message shells, core catalog registration) unless the user explicitly approves promoting the work **or** adding/stabilizing a **Kit component** and core page module.
- When unsure, build in Studio first and note the promotion path in handoff; never register a Studio draft in `prototype-app-routes` / preview catalog until promoted.

## UI separation (Core vs Studio)

- **Core** (`components/prototypes/*-prototype.tsx`, `.feedCompose*` CSS): Git-backed catalog screens. Do not wire Studio-only experiments here.
- **Studio** (`components/studio/*`, `.studioFeedCompose*` CSS): Personal exploration UI in `/canvas/studio`. Iterate layout and interaction here without changing Core previews.
- Shared Kit, media picker sheets (`.feedComposeOverlay` / sheets), and tokens may be reused; page shell layout and draft storage keys must stay split (`feed-compose-session` vs `studio-feed-compose-session`).
- Deleting a Studio project may only remove its catalog record and explicitly allowlisted Studio session data. Never delete Kit, Core prototypes, shared Studio implementations, icons, tokens, shared CSS, Core session data, or `.monkren` design deliverables.
- The legacy `toptop-page-canvas-history-v1` history is retired; do not reintroduce prompt/history persistence into the Studio gallery.

## Studio UI Kit requirement

Prompt 生成的页面块（`PageCanvasStage`、`page-canvas-parser`）和 Studio 专用页面（`components/studio/*`）必须复用 `components/kit` 与 specs 已定义的组件，不得手写重复 Kit 标记：

- 导航 → `PrimaryNavigation` / `RegularNavigation` / `UnderlineSecondaryTab` / `PillSecondaryTab` / `BottomNavigation`
- 搜索 → `SearchControl`
- 列表 → `RegularListItem`
- 图标 → `SystemIcon` / `BottomNavigationIcon`（禁止 `<img>` 引用 SVG 图标）
- 状态栏 → `IosStatusBar`
- 按钮 → `kitButton` 契约类名（见 `specs/components/button.yaml`）

未覆盖区域才允许 `Prototype*` 模块，并在 handoff 中记录 `kitGap`。
